 Looking at this task, I need to create a polyglot file that works as both valid C and valid Python code, computing the kth Fibonacci number.

The key technique is using C preprocessor conditionals (`#if 0`) which Python treats as comments, and Python multi-line strings (`"""`) which hide C code from Python.

